      "text": {
        "jp": "でも、メモしたのは判別できるところだけだから、\r\nちゃんとした文章にはなってないと思うけど……。",
        "official_en": "I’m not sure if they’ll make a coherent sentence, though. The carving was almost completely worn off, so I only wrote down what I could make out.",
